WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:11.560
Lexicon: synonym groups, casual forms and Finglish, so keywords work better: any word in a group also matches every other word in it.

2
00:00:12.106 --> 00:00:18.370
Click "New group", name it, and type the words one by one, pressing Enter after each.

3
00:00:18.918 --> 00:00:28.860
Put formal and casual forms in one group; plurals, word forms, spaces, hyphens and English-keyboard typing are recognised automatically.

4
00:00:29.414 --> 00:00:35.050
Type a sentence in "Which group does this text match?" to see which group it hits.

5
00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:40.270
Click "Save lexicon"; it applies to every automation right away.

6
00:00:40.819 --> 00:00:47.580
Put each word in one group only, and don't add very general words (“good”, “hello”).
